Subject: Keep v2.2 paired-policy hiding without newer SUSFS tracking symbols

CI 42539431924 reached final linking and reported two absent SUSFS symbols.
The pinned v2.2.0 tree uses backup_sepolicy and the sehide1 paired parser;
it does not implement the newer per-type/per-AV bookkeeping functions.
Remove only these new callers/declarations, as in the accepted b88403d2
integration. Retain the actual rule/type edits, new policy-size/xperm fixes,
backup-policy implementation and all UAPI6 functionality. No empty stubs.

